# Declared once, centrally — every apps/web/* and apps/mfe/* chart targets namespace="apps" in
# its own helm(...) call (see turbo/generators/templates/web/Tiltfile), but none of their own
# helm/templates/ create the Namespace object itself. One shared namespace for all frontend
# charts, same as apps/servers/Tiltfile's own "server-apps" covers every server regardless of
# protocol. Declared here (not duplicated in apps/mfe/Tiltfile too) since a second identical
# Namespace object is harmless but redundant — kept in the first Tiltfile Tilt loads.
k8s_yaml(blob("""
apiVersion: v1
kind: Namespace
metadata:
  name: apps
"""))

include("./web1/Tiltfile")
